## SCOPE NOTE (v2 final)
User decided NOT to decommission Watchtower — cliproxyapi is being decommissioned
soon, so leave Watchtower as-is (only manages cliproxyapi). Cron will NOT touch
cliproxyapi. Cron manages only: nextcloud (app/cron/web/redis), immich
(server/ML/redis), jellyfin. Manual-only (excluded): immich_postgres, nextcloud-db.
Watchtower + cliproxyapi are explicitly OUT OF SCOPE for this plan.

## User request
"write a plan to ensure nextcloud, jellyfin and immich on my server called iskra in the vm iskradocker stay updated. i made a plan but i forgot it."

Intent routing: **CLEAR** + explicit interview opt-in ("ask me questions if needed").
User's "forgotten plan" search: nothing found in markdown or `.bash_history`; closest
signal is bash history showing the user investigated watchtower labels on cliproxyapi
(`docker inspect cliproxyapi --format ... | tr ',' '\n' | grep watchtower`).

